{"id":"b1af4753e8e3740a","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-probabilistic-tm.md","title":"Probabilistic Turing Machine","display":"df-probabilistic-tm — Probabilistic Turing Machine","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-probabilistic-tm","aliases":["28-df-probabilistic-tm","Probabilistic Turing Machine"],"display":"df-probabilistic-tm — Probabilistic Turing Machine","depends_on":["[[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]]","[[28-df-tm]]","[[28-df-machine-resources]]"],"source_book_location":"§7.1 Definition 7.1; §7.1 Definition 7.3; printed pp.125–126; PDF pp.151–152","source_printed_pages":"125–126","source_pdf_pages":"151–152","source_status":"statement-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-probabilistic-tm"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-probabilistic-tm</span><span>Probabilistic Turing Machine</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-probabilistic-tm — Probabilistic Turing Machine"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" href=\"?note=0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" title=\"28-df-binary-pair-encoding\">28-df-binary-pair-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1965e2b0765554c9\" href=\"?note=1965e2b0765554c9\" title=\"28-df-tm\">28-df-tm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" href=\"?note=b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" title=\"28-df-machine-resources\">28-df-machine-resources</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"§7.1 Definition 7.1; §7.1 Definition 7.3; printed pp.125–126; PDF pp.151–152"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"125–126"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"151–152"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\">\\(M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\)</span> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1965e2b0765554c9\" href=\"?note=1965e2b0765554c9\" title=\"28-df-tm\">28-df-tm</a> 与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" href=\"?note=b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" title=\"28-df-machine-resources\">28-df-machine-resources</a> 在配对输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,r)\">\\(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,r)\\)</span> 上运行，输出记作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M(x;r)\">\\(M(x;r)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pair}_{01}\">\\(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" href=\"?note=0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" title=\"28-df-binary-pair-encoding\">28-df-binary-pair-encoding</a>，单比特串与相应的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,1\">\\(0,1\\)</span> 认同。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(m:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 为可计算的随机带长度函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{time}_M(x;r)\">\\(\\operatorname{time}_M(x;r)\\)</span> 为停机步数，未停机时取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+\\infty\">\\(+\\infty\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_j\">\\(U_j\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^j\">\\(\\Sigma^j\\)</span> 上均匀分布，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pr[U_j=r]=2^{-j}\">\\(\\Pr[U_j=r]=2^{-j}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{PTM}\">\\(\\mathbf{PTM}\\)</span> 表示本节点的有限随机带、总停机判定机表示。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>最后的接受概率只对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(M,m)\\in\\mathbf{PTM}\">\\((M,m)\\in\\mathbf{PTM}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(x\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span> 定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M(x;r)\\coloneqq M(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,r)),\\qquad \\operatorname{time}_M(x;r)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{time}_M(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,r)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M(x;r)\\coloneqq M(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,r)),\\qquad \\operatorname{time}_M(x;r)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{time}_M(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,r)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{PTM}\\coloneqq\\left\\{(M,m)\\ \\middle|\\ M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\land m:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\land\\exists R\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;[\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;R(1^n)=1^{m(n)}]\\land\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\forall r\\in\\Sigma^{m(|x|)}\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{time}_M(x;r)&lt;\\infty\\land M(x;r)\\in\\{0,1\\}\\bigr)\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf{PTM}\\coloneqq\\left\\{(M,m)\\ \\middle|\\ M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\land m:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\land\\exists R\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;[\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;R(1^n)=1^{m(n)}]\\land\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\forall r\\in\\Sigma^{m(|x|)}\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{time}_M(x;r)&lt;\\infty\\land M(x;r)\\in\\{0,1\\}\\bigr)\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Pr[(M,m)(x)=1]\\coloneqq 2^{-m(|x|)}\\left|\\{r\\in\\Sigma^{m(|x|)}:M(x;r)=1\\}\\right|.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Pr[(M,m)(x)=1]\\coloneqq 2^{-m(|x|)}\\left|\\{r\\in\\Sigma^{m(|x|)}:M(x;r)=1\\}\\right|.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本书定义 7.1 以两个转移函数和独立公平硬币定义概率机；本节点采用定义 7.3 的有限随机带表示，限于总停机判定计算。无界期望时间的零错误计算另见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"96a7916ef9ebba8a\" href=\"?note=96a7916ef9ebba8a\" title=\"28-df-zpp\">28-df-zpp</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-binary-pair-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"0dfeff4bd5d69b86","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-tm","status":"resolved","id":"1965e2b0765554c9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-tm]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-machine-resources","status":"resolved","id":"b5d4fc2d291ce98b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-machine-resources]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-tm","status":"resolved","id":"1965e2b0765554c9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$M\\in\\mathrm{TM}$ 按 [[28-df-tm]] 与 [[28-df-machine-resources]] 在配对输入 $\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,r)$ 上运行，输出记作 $M(x;r)$；$\\operatorname{pair}_{01}$ 见 [[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]]，单比特串与相应的 $0,1$ 认同。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-machine-resources","status":"resolved","id":"b5d4fc2d291ce98b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$M\\in\\mathrm{TM}$ 按 [[28-df-tm]] 与 [[28-df-machine-resources]] 在配对输入 $\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,r)$ 上运行，输出记作 $M(x;r)$；$\\operatorname{pair}_{01}$ 见 [[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]]，单比特串与相应的 $0,1$ 认同。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-binary-pair-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"0dfeff4bd5d69b86","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$M\\in\\mathrm{TM}$ 按 [[28-df-tm]] 与 [[28-df-machine-resources]] 在配对输入 $\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,r)$ 上运行，输出记作 $M(x;r)$；$\\operatorname{pair}_{01}$ 见 [[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]]，单比特串与相应的 $0,1$ 认同。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-zpp","status":"resolved","id":"96a7916ef9ebba8a","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"本书定义 7.1 以两个转移函数和独立公平硬币定义概率机；本节点采用定义 7.3 的有限随机带表示，限于总停机判定计算。无界期望时间的零错误计算另见 [[28-df-zpp]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"M\\in\\mathrm{TM}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,r)","display":false},{"tex":"M(x;r)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pair}_{01}","display":false},{"tex":"0,1","display":false},{"tex":"m:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{time}_M(x;r)","display":false},{"tex":"+\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"U_j","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma^j","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pr[U_j=r]=2^{-j}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{PTM}","display":false},{"tex":"(M,m)\\in\\mathbf{PTM}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"M(x;r)\\coloneqq M(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,r)),\\qquad \\operatorname{time}_M(x;r)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{time}_M(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,r)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf{PTM}\\coloneqq\\left\\{(M,m)\\ \\middle|\\ M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\land m:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\land\\exists R\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;[\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;R(1^n)=1^{m(n)}]\\land\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\forall r\\in\\Sigma^{m(|x|)}\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{time}_M(x;r)<\\infty\\land M(x;r)\\in\\{0,1\\}\\bigr)\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Pr[(M,m)(x)=1]\\coloneqq 2^{-m(|x|)}\\left|\\{r\\in\\Sigma^{m(|x|)}:M(x;r)=1\\}\\right|.","display":true}],"bytes":2063,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-111","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"概率机器与类：[[28-df-probabilistic-tm]]、[[28-df-bpp]]、[[28-df-rp]]、[[28-df-co-rp]]、[[28-df-zpp]]、[[28-df-pp]]。"}],"outgoing":["0dfeff4bd5d69b86","1965e2b0765554c9","b5d4fc2d291ce98b","96a7916ef9ebba8a"]}